{"suttaId":"thag1.116","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[670,673],"vripara":"116"},"segments":{"thag1.116:0.4":"Pārāpariyattheragāthā","thag1.116:1.1":"“Chaphassāyatane hitvā,","thag1.116:1.2":"guttadvāro susaṃvuto;","thag1.116:1.3":"Aghamūlaṃ vamitvāna,","thag1.116:1.4":"patto me āsavakkhayo”ti.","thag1.116:1.5":"… Pārāpariyo [pārāsariyo (sī.), pāraṃpariyo (ka.)] thero …."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":2919,"to":2919,"paras":[{"para":2919,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.116:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>chaphassāyatane hitvā</b>ti cakkhusamphassādīnaṃ channaṃ samphassānaṃ uppattiṭṭhānatāya “phassāyatanānī”ti laddhanāmāni cakkhādīni cha ajjhattikāyatanāni tappaṭibaddhasaṃkilesappahānavasena pahāya.","<b>Guttadvāro susaṃvuto</b>ti tato eva cakkhudvārādīnaṃ guttattā, tattha pavattanakānaṃ abhijjhādīnaṃ pāpadhammānaṃ pavesananivāraṇena satikavāṭena suṭṭu pihitattā guttadvāro susaṃvuto.","Atha vā manacchaṭṭhānaṃ channaṃ dvārānaṃ vuttanayena rakkhitattā guttadvāro, kāyādīhi suṭṭhu saññatattā susaṃvutoti evamettha attho veditabbo.","<b>Aghamūlaṃ vamitvānā</b>ti aghassa vaṭṭadukkhassa mūlabhūtaṃ avijjābhavataṇhāsaṅkhātaṃ dosaṃ, sabbaṃ vā kilesadosaṃ ariyamaggasaṅkhātavamanayogapānena uggiritvā santānato bahi katvā, bahikaraṇahetu vā.","<b>Patto me āsavakkhayo</b>ti kāmāsavādayo āsavā ettha khīyanti, tesaṃ vā khayena pattabboti āsavakkhayo, nibbānaṃ arahattañca.","So āsavakkhayo patto adhigatoti udānavasena aññaṃ byākāsi."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.116:1"],["thag1.116:1"],["thag1.116:1"],["thag1.116:1"],["thag1.116:1"],["thag1.116:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.116:1.1","chaphassāyatane hitvā",0,0],["thag1.116:1.1","guttadvāro susaṃvuto",0,1],["thag1.116:1.3","aghamūlaṃ vamitvānā",0,3],["thag1.116:1.3","patto me āsavakkhayo",0,4]],"before":[{"para":2852,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":2853,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Chaphassāyatane hitvā</b>ti āyasmato pārāpariyattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave puññāni upacinanto piyadassissa bhagavato kāle nesādayoniyaṃ nibbattitvā tassa viññutaṃ pattassa vicaraṇaṭṭhāne aññatarasmiṃ vanasaṇḍe piyadassī bhagavā taṃ anuggaṇhituṃ nirodhasamāpattiṃ samāpajjitvā nisīdi.","So ca mige pariyesanto taṃ ṭhānaṃ gato satthāraṃ disvā pasannamānaso bhagavantaṃ anto katvā kataṃ sākhāmaṇḍapaṃ padumapupphehi kūṭāgārākārena sañchādetvā uḷāraṃ pītisomanassaṃ paṭisaṃvedento sattāhaṃ namassamāno aṭṭhāsi.","Divase divase ca milātamilātāni apanetvā abhinavehi chādesi.","Satthā sattāhassa accayena nirodhato vuṭṭhahitvā bhikkhusaṅghaṃ anussari.","Tāvadeva asītisahassamattā bhikkhū satthāraṃ parivāresuṃ.","“Madhuradhammakathaṃ suṇissāmā”ti devatā sannipatiṃsu, mahā samāgamo ahosi.","Satthā anumodanaṃ karonto tassa devamanussesu bhāviniṃ sampattiṃ imasmiṃ buddhuppāde sāvakabodhiñca byākaritvā pakkāmi.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde rājagahe brāhmaṇakule nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patto tiṇṇaṃ vedānaṃ pāragū hutvā parāparagottatāya <b>pārāpariyo</b>ti laddhasamañño bahū brāhmaṇe mante vācento satthu rājagahagamane buddhānubhāvaṃ disvā paṭiladdhasaddho pabbajitvā vipassanāya kammaṃ karonto nacirasseva arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.40.353-385)–"]},{"para":2854,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Piyadassī nāma bhagavā, sayambhū lokanāyako;"]},{"para":2855,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vivekakāmo sambuddho, samādhikusalo muni."]},{"para":2856,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Vanasaṇḍaṃ samoggayha, piyadassī mahāmuni;"]},{"para":2857,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Paṃsukūlaṃ pattharitvā, nisīdi purisuttamo."]},{"para":2858,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, araññe kānane ahaṃ;"]},{"para":2859,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pasadaṃ migamesanto, āhiṇḍāmi ahaṃ tadā."]},{"para":2860,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tatthaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, oghatiṇṇamanāsavaṃ;"]},{"para":2861,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pupphitaṃ sālarājaṃva, sataraṃsiṃva uggataṃ."]},{"para":2862,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Disvānahaṃ devadevaṃ, piyadassiṃ mahāyasaṃ;"]},{"para":2863,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Jātassaraṃ samoggayha, padumaṃ āhariṃ tadā."]},{"para":2864,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Āharitvāna padumaṃ, satapattaṃ manoramaṃ;"]},{"para":2865,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Kūṭāgāraṃ karitvāna, chādayiṃ padumenahaṃ."]},{"para":2866,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Anukampako kāruṇiko, piyadassī mahāmuni;"]},{"para":2867,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sattarattindivaṃ buddho, kūṭāgāre vasī jino."]},{"para":2868,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Purāṇaṃ chaḍḍayitvāna, navena chādayiṃ ahaṃ;"]},{"para":2869,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, aṭṭhāsiṃ tāvade ahaṃ."]},{"para":2870,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Vuṭṭhahitvā samādhimhā, piyadassī mahāmuni;"]},{"para":2871,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Disaṃ anuvilokento, nisīdi lokanāyako."]},{"para":2872,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tadā sudassano nāma, upaṭṭhāko mahiddhiko;"]},{"para":2873,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Cittamaññāya buddhassa, piyadassissa satthuno."]},{"para":2874,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Asītiyā sahassehi, bhikkhūhi parivārito;"]},{"para":2875,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vanante sukhamāsīnaṃ, upesi lokanāyakaṃ."]},{"para":2876,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yāvatā vanasaṇḍamhi, adhivatthā ca devatā;"]},{"para":2877,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Buddhassa cittamaññāya, sabbe sannipatuṃ tadā."]},{"para":2878,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Samāgatesu yakkhesu, kumbhaṇḍe saharakkhase;"]},{"para":2879,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhikkhusaṅghe ca sampatte, gāthā pabyāharī jino."]},{"para":2880,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Thomaṃ sattāhaṃ pūjesi, āvāsañca akāsi me;"]},{"para":2881,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato."]},{"para":2882,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sududdasaṃ sunipuṇaṃ, gambhīraṃ suppakāsitaṃ;"]},{"para":2883,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ñāṇena kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato."]},{"para":2884,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Catuddasāni kappāni, devarajjaṃ karissati;"]},{"para":2885,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Kūṭāgāraṃ mahantassa, padmapupphehi chāditaṃ."]},{"para":2886,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ākāse dhārayissati, pupphakammassidaṃ phalaṃ;"]},{"para":2887,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Catubbīse kappasate, vokiṇṇaṃ saṃsarissati."]},{"para":2888,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tattha pupphamayaṃ byamhaṃ, ākāse dhārayissati;"]},{"para":2889,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Yathā padumapattamhi, toyaṃ na upalimpati."]},{"para":2890,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tathevīmassa ñāṇamhi, kilesā nopalimpare;"]},{"para":2891,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Manasā vinivaṭṭetvā, pañca nīvaraṇe ayaṃ."]},{"para":2892,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Cittaṃ janetvā nekkhamme, agārā pabbajissati;"]},{"para":2893,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tato pupphamaye byamhe, dhārente nikkhamissati."]},{"para":2894,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Rukkhamūle vasantassa, nipakassa satīmato;"]},{"para":2895,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tattha pupphamayaṃ byamhaṃ, matthake dhārayissati."]},{"para":2896,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;"]},{"para":2897,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Datvāna bhikkhusaṅghassa, nibbāyissatināsavo."]},{"para":2898,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kūṭāgārena caratā, pabbajjaṃ abhinikkhamiṃ;"]},{"para":2899,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Rukkhamūle vasantampi, kūṭāgāraṃ dharīyati."]},{"para":2900,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Cīvare piṇḍapāte ca, cetanā me na vijjati;"]},{"para":2901,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Puññakammena saṃyutto, labhāmi pariniṭṭhitaṃ."]},{"para":2902,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Gaṇanāto asaṅkheyyā, kappakoṭī bahū mama;"]},{"para":2903,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Rittakā te atikkantā, pamuttā lokanāyakā."]},{"para":2904,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, piyadassī vināyako;"]},{"para":2905,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tamahaṃ payirupāsitvā, imaṃ yoniṃ upāgato."]},{"para":2906,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Idha passāmi sambuddhaṃ, anomaṃ nāma cakkhumaṃ;"]},{"para":2907,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tamahaṃ upagantvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ."]},{"para":2908,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Dukkhassantakaro buddho, maggaṃ me desayī jino;"]},{"para":2909,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tassa dhammaṃ suṇitvāna, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ."]},{"para":2910,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tosayitvāna sambuddhaṃ, gotamaṃ sakyapuṅgavaṃ;"]},{"para":2911,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo."]},{"para":2912,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;"]},{"para":2913,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":2914,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."]},{"para":2915,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvā attano paṭipattiṃ paccavekkhitvā sañjātasomanasso udānavasena –"]},{"para":2917,"vripara":"116","title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Chaphassāyatane hitvā, guttadvāro susaṃvuto;"]},{"para":2918,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Aghamūlaṃ vamitvāna, patto me āsavakkhayo”ti.","– gāthaṃ abhāsi;"]}],"after":[{"para":2920,"vripara":null,"title":"Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pārāpariyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
